D5 (gromos++ 9cd9f6b3): ext_ti_ana books the dihedral dH/dl without dLambda/dlambda.
gromos++/programs/ext_ti_ana.cc:819-828 multiply every term (kin, bond, ang, impr, disres, dihres, disfld) by X[p].dlam;
:830 adds sfeDih[0] (FREEABDIH[0] = B - A) without dih[p].dlam, which is exact only for linear Lambda_dih.
Fix: if(!no_dih) dE += sfeDih[0] * dih[p].dlam; (dih is the LambdaStruct vector of :600).

diff --git a/gromos++/programs/ext_ti_ana.cc b/gromos++/programs/ext_ti_ana.cc
